# ATD QBO Platform - Environment Variables
#
# This project uses Firebase Cloud Functions v2 which reads environment
# variables from functions/.env (NOT the root .env).
#
# Copy functions/.env.example to functions/.env and fill in the values:
#
#   cp functions/.env.example functions/.env
#
# Required variables (set in functions/.env):
#
#   QBO_CLIENT_ID=your_intuit_oauth_client_id
#   QBO_CLIENT_SECRET=your_intuit_oauth_client_secret
#   CLAUDE_API_KEY=your_anthropic_claude_api_key
#
# Do NOT use "firebase functions:config:set" - that is the v1 pattern.
# This project uses v2 Cloud Functions which load from functions/.env.
